      "message": "Reference Model: Modularize the interface of the rule analyzer\n\nTo modularize the interface of the rule analyzer, this commits adds two\nstructure, iopmp_rule_analyzer_input_t and iopmp_rule_analyzer_output_t,\nrepresenting input and output information of the rule analyzer. The\ninput information is assigned before entring iopmpRuleAnalyzer().\n\nThis commit also separates the check result from single\niopmpMatchStatus_t to the matching statues and permission granting\nresult to improve code readability.",
