      "message": "Reference Model: Add test case for chk_x=0\n\nWhen chk_x=0 the IOPMP does not distinguish an instruction fetch\ntransaction from a data read transaction. The transaction would be\nchecked by IOPMP based on read permissions instead. The expected ttype\nand etype would be \"Read access\" and \"illegal read access\" respectively.",
